{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぇいうぇいうぇーい✩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のおに魂感謝祭は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていただけましたか？ʚ♡ɞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわ〜なんだか月曜日にはない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤優里見せすぎて本当にポンコツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っぷりを見せてしまいました。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにもポンコツだなんて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古坂さんにも夏江ちゃんにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われちゃったからな...泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも以心伝心ゲームに失敗して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2杯も飲んでしまった.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの、おのちゃんのせんぶり茶。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずすぎてあのね、本当に月曜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりも味に濃くをましててかなり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不味かったの。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近せんぶり茶飲みすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対胃の中が綺麗になってるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体の中から綺麗に斉藤です。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして空き時間中に夏江ちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮ったよっ⁽⁽꒰๑•‧̮ૣ•ૣ๑꒱⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/10/23/6226740/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとね、辛いの食べに行こうねって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋ってるからね本当に行きたいの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度さそうんだ夏江ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古坂さんとは時間合わなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮れ